OL,3,ASuspended Reform UK member vows to
OL,4,Afight to remain in party
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical commentator Tim Montgomerie
OL,7,Fhas told BBC Newsnight he will fight
OL,8,Fhis suspension from Reform UK for
OL,9,Fcriticising senior party figures in
OL,10,Fmedia interviews.
OL,12,FHe said his appeal against suspension
OL,13,Fwould be a test case of whether Reform
OL,14,Fcould tolerate free speech.
OL,16,FThe party said Montgomerie had been
OL,17,Fsuspended in line with its rules after
OL,18,Fpublic criticism he made.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
