OL,3,ASuspended Reform UK member vows to
OL,4,Afight to remain in party
OL,5,
OL,6,FMontgomerie is a right-of-centre
OL,7,Fpolitical commentator who defected from
OL,8,Fthe Conservatives to Reform UK in 2024,
OL,9,Fand who has seen himself as a critical
OL,10,Ffriend of the party leadership.
